392
00:34:27,080 --> 00:34:32,680
We determined that for this tree to have a successful transplant, we sized the root ball at 12 foot diameter.

393
00:34:34,140 --> 00:34:38,080
The root ball is a neat package encased in burlap and steel wire.

394
00:34:40,500 --> 00:34:42,140
